<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.7">
<l>koḻuppuṭaiya ceḻuṅkuruti koḻittiḻintu kumiḻtteṟiya</l>
<l>piḻakkuṭaiya vacurarkaḷaip piṇampaṭutta perumāṉūr</l>
<l>taḻuppariya cantaṉaṅkaḷ taṭavaraivā yīrttukoṇṭu</l>
<l>teḻippuṭaiya kāvirivan taṭitoḻuñcī raraṅkamē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city of Perumāṉ who made corpses of villanous demons</l>
<l rend="indent">such that [their] blood, abundant with flesh and fat,</l>
<l rend="indent">bubbled up [and] showered down,</l>
<l>is beautiful Araṅkam where the roaring Kāveri</l>
<l rend="indent">comes worshipping [his] feet,</l>
<l rend="indent">carrying along Sandal trees from the vast mountains</l>
<l rend="indent">[so big they are] difficult to embrace.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
